## Interface: 16001, 120105
## Title: Speed Leveling
## Notes: One key for questing, pressed again and again: it loots the corpse beside you, talks to the quest giver in front of you, picks up what your quests want, attacks your foe, or finds and marks what your quests and your guide want around you; it hearths when your guide says so, and uses a quest item when nothing is around. At a quest giver it takes and hands in your guide's quests. Shows your leveling guide's steps over the world, run by Sane UI itself. Give it a key in the game's key bindings, under Sane UI.
## Author: Saneroki
## Version: 0.3.0
## Category: Sane UI
## Group: SaneUI
## Dependencies: SaneUI
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\Ability_Hunter_MarkedForDeath
## X-License: MIT

